== PHonE_DoG(D_P) ==
BD is '''always on the telephone''' whenever he plays QW, usually talking to his [[Image:flag_ca.gif]] '''girlfriend''' or contributing news to major television networks.  He has been known to call up his opponents after a match in order to explain to them that he won, and sometimes he calls [[Image:flag_ca.gif]] [[zeeshan]] during games in order to ask for QW advice.

One time during an [[EQL]] match, BD received a phone call from [[Image:flag_ca.gif]] '''The Prime Minister of Canada''' who offered to [[ghosting|ghost]] for him over [[QTV]], but BD explained to [[Image:flag_ca.gif]] '''The Prime Minister''' that QTV is lagged to prevent ghosting.  [[Image:flag_ca.gif]] '''The Prime Minister of Canada''' & BD are now very good friends and they organize parades together.

